# THE ONLY REDIRECT IN THE SYSTEM (WEB_BUILD_BRIEF N7 · LANDING_PAGE_GUIDE §2).
#
# The bare root, 302, on Accept-Language, defaulting to English when the header
# is absent or ambiguous. Nothing else redirects — `praxisls.com/en/pricing`
# serves English to a French browser, always, because a deep link that gets
# rewritten is a deep link that cannot be shared or crawled.
#
# This file is Netlify / Cloudflare Pages syntax. A static build cannot read a
# request header, so the redirect has to be host configuration; the equivalent
# for another host is in HANDOFF.md § "The root redirect", along with what to do
# about the apex, which is NOT idle — see LANDING_PAGE_GUIDE.md §7 on the mail
# OAuth callback before repointing anything.
#
# The `!` forces the rule ahead of the static /index.html that also ships. That
# file is the fallback for a host which ignores this one: it offers both
# languages and redirects nobody.
/  /fr/  302!  Language=fr
/  /en/  302!
